meta {
  name: Collection Summary (Metric Cards)
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/orders/collection-summary?statuses=ORDER,APPOINTMENT,CANCELLED&dimension=all
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  statuses: ORDER,APPOINTMENT,CANCELLED
  dimension: all
  ~dateFrom: 2026-07-01
  ~dateTo: 2026-07-31
  ~branchId: {{branchId}}
  ~userId: {{personId}}
  ~referralPanelId: {{referralPanelId}}
  ~departmentId: {{departmentId}}
  ~paymentMode: UPI
  ~search: john
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Aggregate metric-card totals for the Finance → Reports → Collection page, scoped
  to the active tab via `dimension` (all / userwise / b2b / ref-by /
  internal-referral / external-referral / int-ref-user / ext-ref-user / outsource /
  lab-test / lab-panel / department / category / subcategory / discount / back-dated /
  advance-dated / home-collection — same set as Billing). Returns the standard
  totals **plus the payment-mode breakdown**:

  ```json
  { "gross": 0, "discount": 0, "net": 0, "paid": 0, "due": 0, "tds": 0,
    "cash": 0, "upi": 0, "bankTransfer": 0, "debitCard": 0, "creditCard": 0 }
  ```

  Realization scope: only orders that collected money. `paid = cash + upi +
  bankTransfer + debitCard + creditCard` (WALLET excluded). Same scope + allocation
  as `/orders/collection-records` and `/orders/collection-summary/grouped`, so the
  cards always equal Σ records = Σ summary. Whole rupees; branch from the JWT.
}
